    "f-button-1721368777DXyIP-button_label_html": "our voice",
    "f-button-1721368777EFhV3-button_label_html": "curator of style",
    "f-button-17213687778qxOt-button_label_html": "we are a community",
    "f-heading-1721368777yqJhO-text_html": "what is the future rocks?",
    "f-richtext-1721368777QBX4P-text_html": "THE FUTURE ROCKS is an e-commerce marketplace specializing in designer jewelry made from science-driven materials ​that share values of sustainability, innovation, and creativity. ​",
    "f-heading-1721368777PJkZZ-text_html": "our position",
    "f-heading-1721368777ZjfGe-text_html": "#vanitywithaconscience",
    "f-heading-1721368777Mf18k-text_html": "curator of style",
    "f-richtext-1721368777pcigl-text_html": "Science-driven materials are revolutionizing the jewelry industry by addressing traditional design limitations and introducing new possibilities for creativity and functionality. We are the pioneers and advocates of this transformative movement.",
    "f-heading-1721368777YBauD-text_html": "we are a community",
    "f-richtext-1721368777o65Ds-text_html": "Our mission is to accelerate the recognition of conscious and future-forward jewelry design that aligns perfectly with the growing consumer demand for sustainability and ethical practices.<br /><br />This mission requires collective effort and collaboration across various disciplines.",
    "f-richtext-1721368777Lbds2-text_html": "<ul>\n<li>Industry Partnerships</li>\n<li>Alliances with Sustainability Organizations</li>\n<li>Community and Customer Engagement</li>\n<li>Educational Collaborations</li>\n<li>Advocacy and Public Relations</li>\n<li>Technological Collaboration</li>\n<li>Consumer Awareness Campaigns</li>\n</ul>",
